## 💻 Fast-Start: How to Run Locally

Since this repository is completely serverless and lightweight:
1.  Clone the repository.
2.  Double-click `index(11).html` to open the interactive generator.
3.  Double-click `index.html` to view the comprehensive companion instructions.

